<title>JAPAN: BADMINTON-RESULTS OF FINALS IN JAPAN OPEN.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-RESULTS OF FINALS IN JAPAN OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of finals in the Japan</p>
<p>Open badminton championships on Sunday:</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>Peter Rasmussen (Denmark) beaat Park Song-woo (South Korea)</p>
<p>15-3 15-1</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>Mia Audina (Indonesia) beat Gong Zhichao (China) 11-3 2-11 11-5</p>
<p>Men's doubles</p>
<p>Rexy Mainaky/Ricky Subagdja (Indonesia) beat Antoniuss/Denny</p>
<p>Kantono (Indonesia) 15-11 7-15 15-7</p>
<p>Women's doubles</p>
<p>Gu Jun/Ge Fei (China) beat Eliza/Zelin Resiana (Indonesia) 2-15</p>
<p>15-12 15-1</p>
<p>Mixed doubles</p>
<p>Ge Jun/Liu Young (China) beat Marlene Thomsen/Jens Eriksen</p>
<p>(Denmark) 15-8 15-10</p>
</text>
